    "Other categories use short practical frames that keep the target Persian form intact and understandable in context.",
    "An explicit complete example trio already stored on a card always wins over generated policy output.",
    "Step 23 native Iranian review remains responsible for final naturalness approval; Step 19 guarantees complete, structurally valid examples now."
